  "vector_memory": {
    "semantic_summary": "The HistoryManager service orchestrates the complete lifecycle of chat history, acting as the bridge between in-memory chat sessions and persistent disk storage. It handles session initialization, allowing history to be loaded upon startup or swapped dynamically mid-session. Key logic ensures data integrity by preventing message duplication during loading and enforcing idempotency during message addition. It manages persistence via file I/O and interacts closely with the Chat object state."
  },
